OL,3,AIsrael and US warn UK as it plans
OL,4,Asanctions on Israeli settlements in
OL,5,Aoccupied West Bank
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsraeli and US officials warn the UK
OL,8,Fover plans to impose sanctions on trade
OL,9,Ffrom Israeli settlements in the
OL,10,Fillegally occupied West Bank
OL,12,FDates, mangoes and avocados are among
OL,13,Fthe produce exported from settlements -
OL,14,Fhere's how the UK handles such goods
OL,16,FIsrael's President Isaac Herzog calls
OL,17,Fthe restrictions a "grave
OL,18,Fmiscalculation"
