OL,3,AIsrael and US warn UK as it plans
OL,4,Asanctions on Israeli settlements in
OL,5,Aoccupied West Bank
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, US ambassador to Israel Mike
OL,8,FHuckabee tells the BBC British firms
OL,9,Fcould be "banned" from doing business
OL,10,Fin a number of US states
OL,12,FAll Israeli settlements in the West
OL,13,FBank are illegal under international
OL,14,Flaw. The UK sanctions come as Israel
OL,15,Fplans to develop 1,200 new homes in the
OL,16,Foccupied territory
OL,18,FSettler attacks on Palestinians have
OL,19,Falso increased this year, with the UN
OL,20,Fsaying injuries have risen to an
OL,21,Faverage of three a day
